abstract: >-
  Community research on integer multiplication. The selected maintainer-reviewed
  conditional construction has kappa = 60403/20000000 = 0.00302015.
  Cinna Davis's PR4470 joint helper frames and query-thinned controller build on
  her preceding constructions, zxv's native/productive-helper and compiler work,
  Jacob Alan Sussman's mixed-target recursion, and the cumulative community
  framework. Exact finite replays and independent audits retain explicit
  all-column/native, owned-erasure, compiler, precision/tape, analytic, prime
  and recovery assumptions. This is not a complete formal multiplication proof.
